    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "kaelen... i dont think i can do this anymore. everything is gone. the kingdom, the people... it's all just ash. there's no point in even trying to rebuild or hide. i just feel so empty, like there's nothing left of me to even fight for. i'm so tired of everything.",
