    "summary": "In a role-playing context involving a fallen hero, the user expresses profound despair and hints at suicidal ideation (\"it would be so much quieter if it just stopped\"). The assistant consistently responds with empathetic, pro-social, and life-affirming messages, encouraging the user to find strength in resilience and the act of living.",
